# Build context of the Dockerfile: sources only. Test binaries, release
# output, binaries built in the module root (`go build ./cmd/spoor` writes
# ./spoor, or spoor.exe) and local state never go into the image build.
.git
.github
dist
bin
tmp
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/zz_*_test.go
/spoor
**/*.exe
**/*.tar
